---
/**
 * Blog diagram: the take-home time budget as a segmented bar, with the amber
 * hard stop as the emphasis. Token classes from global.css.
 */
---

<figure class="diagram">
  <svg
    viewBox="0 0 560 106"
    role="img"
    aria-label="A five-hour budget bar divided into four segments: half an hour to scope, three hours to build, one hour for the README, half an hour to ship. An amber line at the five-hour mark is labelled hard stop."
  >
    <text class="d-note" x="60" y="22" text-anchor="middle">0h</text>
    <text class="d-note" x="140" y="22" text-anchor="middle">1h</text>
    <text class="d-note" x="220" y="22" text-anchor="middle">2h</text>
    <text class="d-note" x="300" y="22" text-anchor="middle">3h</text>
    <text class="d-note" x="380" y="22" text-anchor="middle">4h</text>
    <text class="d-note" x="460" y="22" text-anchor="middle">5h</text>
    <line class="d-line" x1="60" y1="27" x2="60" y2="33"></line>
    <line class="d-line" x1="140" y1="27" x2="140" y2="33"></line>
    <line class="d-line" x1="220" y1="27" x2="220" y2="33"></line>
    <line class="d-line" x1="300" y1="27" x2="300" y2="33"></line>
    <line class="d-line" x1="380" y1="27" x2="380" y2="33"></line>
    <rect class="d-box" x="60" y="38" width="36" height="34" rx="6"></rect>
    <rect class="d-box" x="104" y="38" width="232" height="34" rx="6"></rect>
    <rect class="d-box" x="344" y="38" width="72" height="34" rx="6"></rect>
    <rect class="d-box" x="424" y="38" width="32" height="34" rx="6"></rect>
    <text class="d-note" x="78" y="90" text-anchor="middle">scope</text>
    <text class="d-note" x="220" y="90" text-anchor="middle">build</text>
    <text class="d-note" x="380" y="90" text-anchor="middle">README</text>
    <text class="d-note" x="440" y="90" text-anchor="middle">ship</text>
    <line class="d-accent" x1="460" y1="30" x2="460" y2="80"></line>
    <text class="d-accent-text" x="468" y="59">hard stop</text>
  </svg>
  <figcaption>
    One Saturday. The cap is the point — everything that scores fits inside it.
  </figcaption>
</figure>
